    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TreeTale</strong> is a HACK&amp;SLASH<strong> RPG</strong> that combines limitless customization with strategic combat. Players can freely build their characters using an extensive <strong>Passive Tree and Large Passive Node Customization System</strong>, while the <strong>Skill Customization System</strong> allows them to refine their combat style to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast <strong>Passive Tree</strong> and develop your character in any direction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/4de79626e3fa1a6b6199f3db794bd39e.poster.avif?t=1749537318\" width=800 height=816 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/4de79626e3fa1a6b6199f3db794bd39e.webm?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/4de79626e3fa1a6b6199f3db794bd39e.mp4?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune major attributes with the <strong>Large Passive Node Customization System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/7eeb3df5507d0914a319ccae2a238ff2.poster.avif?t=1749537318\" width=800 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/7eeb3df5507d0914a319ccae2a238ff2.webm?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/7eeb3df5507d0914a319ccae2a238ff2.mp4?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can directly adjust your skills using the <strong>Skill Customization System</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/c506b303f712fc831baf3bac179c5c94.poster.avif?t=1749537318\" width=523 height=903 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/c506b303f712fc831baf3bac179c5c94.webm?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own build and design your character in any direction you desire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/04309bbafc823f5be938430382d0504e.poster.avif?t=1749537318\" width=442 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/04309bbafc823f5be938430382d0504e.webm?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/04309bbafc823f5be938430382d0504e.mp4?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/89fcc64de325775c610d37c8beca4801.poster.avif?t=1749537318\" width=464 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/89fcc64de325775c610d37c8beca4801.webm?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/89fcc64de325775c610d37c8beca4801.mp4?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/f064e0fad9962626e1d0959861655839.poster.avif?t=1749537318\" width=356 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/f064e0fad9962626e1d0959861655839.webm?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/f064e0fad9962626e1d0959861655839.mp4?t=1749537318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
